  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Protection of Vulnerable Migrants in Central Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IOM Strategy for Europe and Central Asia engagement on protection of migrants from violence, exploitation and abuse in Central Asia. 
Outcome 1. Vulnerable migrants, including unaccompanied children and victims of trafficking, are able to access and benefit from protection-related services that support their rights and dignity
Outcome 2. Governments and civil society stakeholders provide gender and child sensitive protection and assistance to vulnerable migrants</narrative>
  </description>
